NV_PK(29,{"taipei zoo maokong gondola zhinan temple tea farms":"","the quickest way to remember the districts is west to east the oldest ground is in the west along the river the commercial middle came next the east and the outskirts are newest the west has the history the east has the money and the north has the mountains":"","its highest peak mount qixing is 1 120 meters the highest point in taipei yangmingshan xiaoyoukeng and qingtiangang are up here":"","from almost anywhere in the city you can reach a mountain trail in about half an hour":"","the maokong tea hills and the gondola are on this side of the city":"","old bangka and dadaocheng grew up on its banks and tea once sailed out from here to the world":"","shilin dazhi and neihu lie along it and riverside bike paths follow its levees":""});